        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d20e70c400eb476faa1867aa1ff525ed",
      "statement": "The approval system returns structured actionUUID-tagged error codes: approval_denied (user denied), approval_timeout (no response before timeout), approval_unavailable (approval UI cannot render or actionUUID/origin missing), and approval_origin_changed (active tab origin changed before execution).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0048-client-side-action-approval.md#L357-L367",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e25e3e6b57177a7aac2e4eb9f1dcec8259f14e4684c8f685f3a633fdfc83642f:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/shared/src/background-controller.ts#L1348-L1426",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a1cff4b495a6e1acc54f66df09060aa5de48af59c126016b27c35b5f7be75f0a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_602b68b4176349bbb858d352d2ec8e22",
      "statement": "In an approval-aware batch, denial or timeout of one action is a focused per-action outcome: a denied action records approval_denied for its actionUUID and the batch continues with remaining actions, while a timed-out action records approval_timeout and returns a partial batch_result with focused failed entries for the timed-out and unexecuted actions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0048-client-side-action-approval.md#L281-L316",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bd68272d06356bb261fcb44eff1866c9545ec61d6d95c7063b7db897350e4078:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5071d8bc64cc41c2b280a4ec0295e9d3",
      "statement": "fetch_resource performs a browser fetch with credentials included, exposing session-protected content to the agent, and the MCP tool description explicitly labels it a high-risk tool; it is approval-gated.",
