      "id": "claim_82abc0724c8642bdba7f6716ae47147b",
      "statement": "fill_input cannot write to password fields: the shared content handler's isSupportedTextControl allow-list excludes type=password, so a write attempt returns unsupported_control (surfaced to the agent as browser_error), enforcing a credential-extraction boundary.",
