    {
      "id": "claim_5f3c4ec60d12472e982b172fe1a2bb52",
      "statement": "Screenshots are captured only through the explicit per-call capture_screenshot MCP tool, which captures a single JPEG (quality 80) of the active tab's visible viewport on demand; there is no automatic, periodic, or background screenshot capture.",
