    },
    {
      "id": "claim_df213e46fd464956ae456207125653cd",
      "statement": "Brijio intentionally does not support cookie export, session cloning, browser mirroring, continuous screenshots, continuous DOM streaming, background surveillance, browser history collection, credential extraction, or MFA interception; the capability matrix marks each as intentionally unsupported, a deliberate product boundary rather than a missing feature.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/project/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md#L163-L180",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:053e044117e8c53b4997f4f6d0048619b187e70b7eea44913876006924a1adea:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/security/SECURITY_GUARANTEES.md#L1-L72",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:550b52c09c8cf06737f6e0fc26b0e42d5acdc0bc1106ab8f7b15e1d2bf23284f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_22841aa78ad14d00a7275091dd1395f7",
      "statement": "Trust is placed deliberately — pairing token for browser identity, a separate MCP auth token for agent authorization, the relay for routing only, the user for connection state, and the extension for structured DOM reads — while agent intent, network, cloud relay privacy, and website content are not assumed trustworthy.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/security/TRUST_BOUNDARIES.md#L37-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae3b3b2a62928ceb9ed66d119832ae8ecc4d2bba28d1cfed51ca79ac476b6048:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4789444b5deb4360b0d0e10528341d9c",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md records non-negotiable product invariants that the user explicitly starts and stops the bridge, browser state is available only while the extension is connected, every browser read or action is initiated by an explicit MCP tool or resource request, and continuous streaming, silent surveillance, cookie export, credential extraction, session cloning, and MFA interception must not be added.",
      "evidence": [
        {
